WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:10.680
As always, my mom will come in a few minutes.

2
00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:13.880
Mom: Wake up! It's time to get up.

3
00:00:13.881 --> 00:00:16.589
Hana: But I'm sleepy.

4
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.012
I'm so tired.

5
00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:21.018
Mom: It's already 7:30.

6
00:00:21.019 --> 00:00:24.507
I told you to go to bed earlier.

7
00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:28.981
Hana: Okay, okay, I'm getting up now!

8
00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:33.841
Mom: Put your pajamas away, and don't forget to make your bed.

9
00:00:33.842 --> 00:00:35.787
Mom: I'll be in the kitchen.

10
00:00:35.788 --> 00:00:39.605
Wake Bada up please.

11
00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:44.417
Hana: Bada, put your pajamas away and make your bed too.

12
00:00:44.418 --> 00:00:48.683
Bada: Why do I always have to make my bed?

13
00:00:48.684 --> 00:00:52.271
Hana: You know we need to keep our rooms neat.

14
00:00:52.272 --> 00:00:57.083
Bada: You are not my mother, and this is my room!

15
00:00:57.084 --> 00:01:00.134
I can do whatever I want!

16
00:01:00.135 --> 00:01:04.157
Hana: I'm telling Mom. Mom!

17
00:01:04.158 --> 00:01:08.764
So the day began, with my busy morning.
